@startuml
title HIP-2 — the Hyperliquidity update, run by block transition logic
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #EEF5FF
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #4A78B5
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #F7FAFF
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #4A78B5
skinparam ArrowColor #4A78B5
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F7FAFF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #4A78B5

start
:new block committed;
if (at least 3 s since the last update?) then (no)
  :leave the ladder untouched;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:read the strategy balance;
note right
  Price ladder, fixed at deployment:
  p_0 = startPx
  p_i = round(1.003 x p_i-1)
  so consecutive levels sit 0.3% apart
end note
:target nFull = floor(balance / orderSz)
full ask orders, plus one partial
order of balance mod orderSz;
:place them as ALO orders
in the shared spot book;
note right
  ALO means post-only, so an
  order that would cross is
  rejected rather than taking
end note
:for each tranche that filled
completely, re-place an order of
orderSz on whichever side has balance;
:ladder quotes a 0.3% spread again,
alongside any external market maker
quoting into the same book;
stop
@enduml
